    {
      "kind": "difficulty",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inline": [
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": "The slow fire rate of the familiars makes this challenge difficult, especially in ",
              "style": "plain"
            },
            {
              "kind": "ref",
              "target": {
                "kind": "stage",
                "name": "Womb"
              },
              "label": "Womb"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": " and ",
              "style": "plain"
            },
            {
              "kind": "ref",
              "target": {
                "kind": "stage",
                "name": "Cathedral"
              },
              "label": "Cathedral"
            },
            {
              "kind": "text",
              "text": ". The familiars can also be hard to aim, as they linger behind Isaac.",
              "style": "plain"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "paragraph",
          "inline": [
            {
              "kind": "edition",
              "only": [
                "repentance"
              ],
              "inline": [
                {
                  "kind": "text",
                  "text": " Both Brother Bobby and Sister Maggy have been buffed, making this challenge markedly easier: Brother Bobby now has a higher fire rate; while Sister Maggy has an increased damage of 6 (with BFFS! a respectable 12)",
                  "style": "plain"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
